# Intentionally untracked. Pushing anything under .github/workflows/ requires a
# token with the `workflow` scope, which would not attach to this account. Pages
# is served from docs/ on the branch instead, which needs only `repo`. Keeping
# this ignored stops `git add -A` from silently re-adding it and getting the
# whole push rejected. If the scope is ever granted, drop this line.
.github/workflows/

# Intermediate render. docs/index.html is the published copy.
build/

# 11MB Yahoo profile cache. Regenerable, and it is the single biggest file here.
data/profiles.jsonl

# Research scratch from the tournament rounds
data/v2_batches/
data/*_batches/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Never commit anything holding Jonathan's real positions or balances.
# HOLDING_FRAMEWORK.md lives one level up, outside this repo, for that reason.
holdings*.md
*_private.*
